## Input

```css
@use "sass:list";
@use "sass:map";

$gap:8px;
$x:[- /* minus */ $gap, + /* plus */ $gap, not /* boolean */ false, 1 /* lhs */ < /* rhs */ 2,];
.case-comments-operands { minus:list.nth($x,1); plus:list.nth($x,2); negated:list.nth($x,3); comparison:list.nth($x,4); }

$gap:8px; $x:[
-$gap, // first item
+$gap, // second item
not false,
1 < 2 // final item
]; .case-comments-line-boundary { minus:list.nth($x,1); plus:list.nth($x,2); negated:list.nth($x,3); comparison:list.nth($x,4); }

```


